 PURPOSE OF THIS FILE
-----------------------------------------------------------

This file is a harmless placeholder used for cybersecurity
demonstration and testing purposes.

It simulates a software installer download so that browser
security systems, download verification tools, and browser
extensions can analyze suspicious download behavior.

This file DOES NOT contain:

• executable code
• malware
• scripts
• installers
• payloads

Opening this file will NOT install any software.

-----------------------------------------------------------
 DEMONSTRATION CONTEXT
-----------------------------------------------------------

This file may be downloaded from a simulated software
download website designed for educational cybersecurity
demonstrations.

The goal is to show how users can encounter suspicious
downloads from unknown sources and how security tools
can warn them before installation.

Security tools may analyze:

• file extension (.exe)
• download source domain
• download reputation
• redirect patterns
• suspicious hosting environments

